package components

// OneTimeSecret is the box that hands the owner a secret once (M12-42; README §5 "One-time
// reveal box"): an integration key on the answer to "create a key", a webhook's signing key on
// the answers to "create the webhook" and "rotate its key".
//
// 🔴 THE VALUE IS WRITTEN INTO THE BYTES EXACTLY ONCE: the value attribute of one read-only
// field. No title, no data attribute, no hidden copy, no accessible name that repeats it -- each
// would be a second rendering of a secret the server keeps only as a check value (an API key) or
// sealed (a signing key), and the tests that count the secret's shape in the response
// (TestApiKeyPanel_TheKeyIsShownOnceAndNeverAgain, TestWebhookPanel_TheKeyIsShownOnceAndNeverAgain)
// would read two.
//
// 🔴 THERE IS NO COPY BUTTON. A copy button needs a script, and the panel loads none here
// (README §3 constraint 3); the field selects its whole value on the first press, which is the
// browser's own selection. "I've stored it" is a plain link back to the section: the page it
// opens is a fresh read, which carries the secret nowhere.
//
// It is a status region (polite): it appears on the answer to the owner's own action, and the
// heading says what to do before the field says what it holds. The saffron frame is the warning;
// every word in it is ink (14.0:1 on the saffron tint over paper).
//
// THE COMMENTS IN THIS FILE NAME NO CLASS: Tailwind reads them as source (skill tappa-brand).
templ OneTimeSecret(heading, fieldID, label, secret, doneHref string) {
	<div role="status" class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-[14px] border-2 border-saffron bg-saffron/10 px-4 py-4 text-ink md:px-[18px]">
		<p class="font-display text-[15px] font-bold leading-snug tracking-tight">{ heading }</p>
		<div class="text-[13px] leading-normal">
			{ children... }
		</div>
		<label class="lbl text-ink" for={ fieldID }>{ label }</label>
		<input
			class="field-input field-input--mono select-all text-[13px]"
			id={ fieldID }
			type="text"
			readonly
			autocomplete="off"
			spellcheck="false"
			value={ secret }
		/>
		<a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center self-start font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-tappa-green" href={ templ.URL(doneHref) }>I&#39;ve stored it</a>
	</div>
}
